cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research archive and the public Git commit used. Cite upstream methods and data separately."
type: dataset
title: "Sargasso: Research Archive"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Josiah
    affiliation: Sargasso
version: "2026.09.19"
date-released: 2026-09-19
url: "https://github.com/Jstarzz/Sargasso-Research"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jstarzz/Sargasso-Research"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A curated research archive of sargassum satellite detection, drift forecasting,
  and coastal-risk research. Includes completed experiment summaries, negative
  results, aggregate evaluation records, configuration summaries, source
  provenance, and a chronological research timeline. Restricted data, model
  weights, product code, and unfinished results are not distributed.
keywords:
  - sargassum
  - remote sensing
  - segmentation
  - drift forecasting
  - research provenance
